 practice=[('Find the volume of a 2 by 5 by 6 rectangular prism.','60 cubic units.'),('A cylinder has radius 3 and height 5. Find its exact volume.','45π cubic units.'),('A cone has radius 3 and height 5. Find its exact volume.','15π cubic units.'),('Find the surface area of a 2 by 3 by 4 rectangular prism.','52 square units.'),('A prism has base area 18 and volume 126. Find its height.','7.'),('Which measure determines paint for the outside of a closed box, and which determines its capacity?','Surface area for paint; volume for capacity.')],
